<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n89613" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσ-κλύζω</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποτικλύζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wash with waves</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				6.2.22
			</span></i>: c. dat., <i>dash against</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρίν
				γε θεοῦ τεμένει κῦμα ποτικλύζῃ</span> Orac. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				3.112
			</span></i>; [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρει] προσκλύζει τὸ πέλαγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					5.59.5
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τὴν ἀκρόπολιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Dio</u>
					24
				</span></i>
			: c. acc., <i>lave</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς ὀφθαλμοὺς ὕδατι ψυχρῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Diocl. Fr.
					141
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be washed</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θαλάττῃ</span> by the sea, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				1.31
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				3.10.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς ὄμμασι τοῦ κάλλους μονονουχὶ
					προσκλύζοντος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Am.</u>
					53
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>to be used as a wash</i>, v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.63
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Eup.</u>
				1.119
			</span></i>.</div>
